      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Town_Creek%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Town Creek sits at the crossroads of U.S. Route 72 and State Route 101, linking it to nearby cities.",
